## ERASURE - RUN TO THE SUN (1994)
#  131 BPM, C Major / Bb modal chorus, 147 bars (~4:30).
#  Written by Vince Clarke & Andy Bell (produced by Martyn Ware).
#  From Erasure's critically acclaimed UK #1 album 'I Say I Say I Say' (1994).
#
#  Showcase Architecture & Features:
#    1. Full stream architecture using [ ... ] n>d /SS note arrays with '-' rests
#    2. Human-readable musical score directly embedded in the script
#    3. Vince Clarke bouncing bass groove (steps 0, 2, 3, 5, 6, 10, 12, 14 + turnaround)
#    4. Harmonized Pre-Chorus minor cadence: Dm -> Am -> Cm -> Gm
#    5. 8-bar Modal Chorus: Bb -> Bb -> F -> F -> C -> C -> G -> G
#    6. Self-stopping one-shot snare rolls and 16th-note ascending scale risers
#    7. Dedicated C Major Chant build brass motif (E4-D4-C4-E4)
#    8. Special Bridge in Em - Bm - Dm with authentic pluck and flute fills
#    9. Andy Bell soaring vocal lead with sustained phrasing (s=0.75) and explicit l0 releases
#   10. Sample-accurate stream synchronization via /SP resets in the conductor
#
#  Load:   [run_to_the_sun.sk] /ls
#  Play:   play
#  Stop:   stop
#
#  VOICE MAP:
#    v0  punchy analog kick (w82) + v5 sub body (w0 f440)
#    v1  backbeat snare (w83) + v4 handclap layer (w86)
#    v2  closed hi-hat 16ths (w84)  v3 open hi-hat sizzle (w85)
#    v6  Vince Clarke 16th bass saw (w15, centre) + v7 sub sine octave partner (w0 N-12)
#    v8  Jupiter-8 16th arpeggio centre (w15 saw) + v9 stereo partner (w20 clavi, p.35)
#    v10 synth flute / ocarina solo fills (w29 dwg-bell, p-.45)
#    v12 Vince Clarke octave synth hook & risers (w16 square, p.30)
#    v13 Andy Bell soaring vocal lead (w15 saw, centre) + v14 detuned partner (w16, right)
#    v15 DWGS / Oberheim synth brass stabs & fills (w22 dwg-brass, p-.30)
#    v16 accent cowbell (w96)
#    v17 crash cymbal downbeats (w94)
#    v18 chord bed root (w15) + v19 chord third (w79 solina, p-.55) + v20 chord fifth (w61 choir, p.55)
#    v21 pre-chorus & bridge plucked synth guitar (w25 aguitar, p-.25)
#    v22 ESQ-1 vocal choir pad (w61 voice1) + v23 partner (w62 voice2)
#    v24 pad lfo  v26,v27 pad prototype  v28-v35 warm poly pad pool
#
#  DELAY BUSES:
#    Bus 1: Signature Vince arpeggio dotted-eighth ping-pong echo (DS 1 131 .75, DP 1 1)
#    Bus 2: Bass slapback sixteenth (DS 2 131 .25)
#    Bus 3: Snare & Clap chamber wash (DS 3 131 .5)
#    Bus 4: Vocal lead & choir wide ping-pong hall wash (DS 4 131 .75, DP 4 1)
# ======================================================================

[ERASURE - RUN TO THE SUN (1994)] puts
[use 'play' to start, 'stop' to stop] puts
M 131 16

## DELAY BUSES
# Bus 1: Signature Vince Clarke dotted-eighth ping-pong echo on arpeggios
DS 1 131 .75
DL 1 - - 8 3 4 11
DD 1 7 3
DP 1 1

# Bus 2: Bass slapback 16th
DS 2 131 .25
DL 2 - - 4 0 0 7
DD 2 6 4

# Bus 3: Snare & Clap chamber wash
DS 3 131 .5
DL 3 - - 6 0 0 9
DD 3 5 3

# Bus 4: Vocal lead & choir wide ping-pong hall wash
DS 4 131 .75
DL 4 - - 11 3 8 10
DD 4 8 2
DP 4 1

